title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui workspace new
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui workspace new
summary: Create a workspace and print its id

!! Reference

```
Create a workspace and print its id

Usage: mf gui workspace new [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --repo <REPO>
          Active repository UUID (default: the daemon's first repo)

      --left <LEFT>
          Panel type the left slot shows when the workspace is first put there (default: the workspace's default panel)

      --right <RIGHT>
          Panel type the right slot shows when the workspace is first put there

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
